  "description": "Stay True, stay eccentric! Radical, modern geometry with a very long reach and a super slack head angle make this bike ideal for anyone who likes to go full gas! The bike is built around a strong and light alloy frame built with a custom tube set. Big wheels, plenty of fork travel and dropper post that is included in the package will help you fly down the steepest descents with confidence. If you are a hardtail junky, this is the machine for you.\nREVIEWS:\n”It has a very agile handling which is perfect for flowy trails.” - MTB-News.de\nINTENDED USE CATEGORY 4: XC & TRAIL\nTough and light alloy frame\nRadical geo with slack angles\nrock shox Recon boost 140 mm\nX-FUSION MANIC dropper post\nSHIMANO deore 1x12 dERAILLEUR\nSHIMANO DEORE BRAKES\nShimano deore crankset\nMODERN GEOMETRY\nMost progressive frame geometry on the market.\nTOUGH AND LIGHT ALLOY FRAME\nTange eccentric cromoly tubes (eccentric cromo).\nNS COMPONENTS\nNS Bikes aftermarket components in unique finishes.",
